        349.1717834472656,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        80.14361572265625,
        99.70339965820312,
        109.03961181640625
      ],
      "text": "P",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        100.06320190429688,
        87.01241302490234,
        166.2552032470703,
        107.23960876464844
      ],
      "text": "reface",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 16.799999237060547,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        126.5631103515625,
        513.4835815429688,
        139.91461181640625
      ],
      "text": "The first edition of Guidance for national tuberculosis programmes on the management of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        142.55963134765625,
        513.4949951171875,
        155.9111328125
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis in children was published in 2006. It resulted in the revision or development",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        158.55615234375,
        513.4603881835938,
        171.90765380859375
      ],
      "text": "of guidelines for child TB management by national TB programmes in many TB-endemic",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        174.55267333984375,
        513.4720458984375,
        187.9041748046875
      ],
      "text": "countries. Now, however, newly published evidence and new recommendations have",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        190.5491943359375,
        361.7409973144531,
        203.90069580078125
      ],
      "text": "made it necessary to update the original 2006 guidance.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        222.5537109375,
        513.4374389648438,
        235.90521240234375
      ],
      "text": "Like the original, this second edition aims to inform the revision of existing national",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        238.55023193359375,
        513.3799438476562,
        251.9017333984375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines and standards for managing TB, many of which include guidance on children.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        254.5467529296875,
        513.426025390625,
        267.89825439453125
      ],
      "text": "It includes recommendations, based on the best available evidence, for improving the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        270.54327392578125,
        513.3684692382812,
        283.894775390625
      ],
      "text": "management of children with TB and of children living in families with TB. National and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        286.539794921875,
        513.4834594726562,
        299.89129638671875
      ],
      "text": "regional TB control programmes may wish to adapt these recommendations according",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        302.53631591796875,
        195.34738159179688,
        315.8878173828125
      ],
      "text": "to local circumstances.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        334.54083251953125,
        513.4376220703125,
        347.892333984375
      ],
      "text": "Since 2006 there has been a welcome increase in the attention being given to the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        350.5373229980469,
        513.4949951171875,
        363.8888244628906
      ],
      "text": "specific challenges of TB in children and an increased recognition of its importance as a",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        366.5338134765625,
        513.426025390625,
        379.88531494140625
      ],
      "text": "global public health challenge. Although most children with TB may not be responsible",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        382.5303039550781,
        513.4259033203125,
        395.8818054199219
      ],
      "text": "for widespread transmission of the disease in the community, TB is an important",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        398.52679443359375,
        371.6999206542969,
        411.8782958984375
      ],
      "text": "contributor to maternal and child morbidity and mortality.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        430.53131103515625,
        513.426025390625,
        443.8828125
      ],
      "text": "Following publication of the 2006 guidance, many countries developed national policies",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        446.5278015136719,
        513.3914794921875,
        459.8793029785156
      ],
      "text": "and strategies to address childhood TB. Practical implementation of these strategies,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        462.5242919921875,
        513.4031372070312,
        475.87579345703125
      ],
      "text": "however, has not always been achieved. The challenge now is to address this widespread",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        478.5207824707031,
        467.12701416015625,
        491.8722839355469
      ],
      "text": "policy-practice gap by scaling up childhood TB activities in endemic countries.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        510.5252685546875,
        513.4375610351562,
        523.8767700195312
      ],
      "text": "This publication contains a number of important changes or additions to the first edition;",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        526.5217895507812,
        513.3800048828125,
        539.873291015625
      ],
      "text": "these are highlighted in the Executive summary. It also has separate chapters dealing",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        542.5182495117188,
        510.2521057128906,
        555.8697509765625
      ],
      "text": "with issues that were covered only in annexes to the first edition (management of TB/",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        558.5147094726562,
        513.3683471679688,
        571.8662109375
      ],
      "text": "HIV in children and of drug-resistant TB in children) and introduces new topics such as",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        574.51123046875,
        253.5028839111328,
        587.8627319335938
      ],
      "text": "the importance of integrated care.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        606.5157470703125,
        513.4029541015625,
        619.8672485351562
      ],
      "text": "Efforts have been made to include the management of tuberculosis in adolescents",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        622.5122680664062,
        513.3914184570312,
        635.86376953125
      ],
      "text": "whenever relevant. This is in recognition of the fact that adolescents are a vulnerable",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        638.5087280273438,
        513.3685302734375,
        651.8602294921875
      ],
      "text": "group that is not specifically highlighted in current guidelines for the management of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        654.5052490234375,
        103.577392578125,
        667.8567504882812
      ],
      "text": "TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        686.4982299804688,
        513.4258422851562,
        699.8497314453125
      ],
      "text": "Publication of the first edition of this guidance predated the WHO process for the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        702.4947509765625,
        513.426025390625,
        715.8462524414062
      ],
      "text": "development of evidence-based guidelines; preparation of the second edition, however,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        718.4912719726562,
        513.4144287109375,
        731.8427734375
      ],
      "text": "has adhered to that process. Many current WHO recommendations, already published",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        734.4877319335938,
        513.4375,
        747.8392333984375
      ],
      "text": "in guideline documents for management of TB and HIV, are referred to in this guidance;",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        750.4842529296875,
        513.46044921875,
        763.8357543945312
      ],
      "text": "any earlier recommendation that has been altered, following review, as regards detail,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        766.4807739257812,
        428.406494140625,
        779.832275390625
      ],
      "text": "strength of recommendation and/or quality of evidence is highlighted.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        565.1339111328125,
        805.8439331054688,
        574.3939208984375,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "v",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}